  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:17.490" end="00:21.660" ttm:agent="v1">Don't run away</p>
      <p begin="00:21.660" end="00:25.640" ttm:agent="v1">I'm here to stay</p>
      <p begin="00:25.640" end="00:33.290" ttm:agent="v1">Make me your everything</p>
      <p begin="00:33.290" end="00:36.790" ttm:agent="v1">When I was alone</p>
      <p begin="00:36.790" end="00:41.030" ttm:agent="v1">And I had no one to call on</p>
      <p begin="00:41.030" end="00:45.110" ttm:agent="v1">You turned around</p>
